window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"zac","b":"locke","win":["Skill","Skill","Skill","Zac","Skill","Zac","Zac"],"spikes":[{"when":"Lvl 4-5","text":"E Elastic Slingshot fully charged plus blob sustain is your first real spike - leap from fog his 425-range kit cannot scout, right after his 10s E goes."},{"when":"Lvl 6","text":"Careful: an over-committed dive hands him a totem execute on your low blob-split health - and Silver Stake scales with missing health, so your last quarter is his best."},{"when":"1st item","text":"Your first health item plus passive revive beat Soul Ignition - break the fight off before its duration expires and he banks none of the heal owed."},{"when":"Late","text":"Your HP pool sits far above his execute threshold and Cell Division un-kills you - engage his whole team and let him waste the totem on a puddle."}],"wants":{"you":["Blobs eaten to shrink Silver Stake","Fog-angle Slingshots he cannot scout","An HP pool his totem math cannot reach"],"foe":["Nail chip stacking you toward threshold","Punishing your blob pickups with W burst","R Purgatory timed on your revive puddle"]},"early":"Levels 1-3 are an even skill dance: Ritual Nails marks you and Silver Stake cashes those marks through his autos, but every blob you pick up undoes a nail's worth of chip and shrinks his missing-health bonus at the same time - trade patiently, hoard blobs, and grind the small exchanges even.","mid":"Levels 4-5 are yours: a charged E Elastic Slingshot from fog is an engage his 425-range kit cannot answer, and blob sustain wins the aftermath. At 6 it tightens back up - his R Purgatory punishes an over-committed blob at low health, so wait out Ashen Pursuit, a flat 10s at every rank, then commit.","late":"From your first health item the math abandons him: blob healing plus Cell Division's revive out-lasts his one burst window, and late game your HP pool towers so far above Purgatory's threshold that the totem barely threatens you. One caveat - Cell Division is a 5-minute cooldown, so a second dive inside that window has no net.","whys":["Even at 1: his on-hit grows as you drop, blobs undo that.","Level 2 stays a skill trade around your healing blobs.","Level 3 remains even as his Q burst trades into your sustain.","Levels 4-5 are yours: Slingshot from fog, his E is 10s flat.","Level 6 evens - his R executes, and Silver Stake already hits harder as you drop.","First item: his W pays its heal only when the duration finally ends.","Late, your HP pool and revive survive his poke and execute threshold."]});
