window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"zac","b":"masteryi","win":["Zac","Zac","Zac","Skill","Skill","Master Yi","Master Yi"],"spikes":[{"when":"Lvl 1-2","text":"Q Stretching Strikes poke and blob sustain beat his bare kit - chip from 800 to his 600, and note Alpha Strike turns him untargetable, so it eats your Q."},{"when":"Lvl 6","text":"Let's Bounce! keeps trades even - the knockups still land, though Highlander makes him immune to the slow half - but it stalls him rather than kills: bank farm."},{"when":"1st item","text":"His DPS now burns blob sustain - stop trading, and when he Meditates to heal it back, break the channel with E or R for nothing."},{"when":"Late","text":"His sustained shred beats your tank frame 1v1 - never sidelane him; engage his backline and let your team handle the Yi."}],"wants":{"you":["Early poke he cannot answer itemless","Knockups that break his Meditate channel","Teamfights instead of sidelane duels"],"foe":["Meditate stalling into his item spikes","Alpha Strike dodging your Q and E engage","Late duels where shred melts your HP"]},"early":"Levels 1-2 you bully him comfortably: Q Stretching Strikes pokes from 800 to his 600, a range his melee kit cannot answer, and blob pickups heal back whatever his single Alpha Strike replies with - zone him off CS now, because every auto he lands is already shortening that Alpha Strike.","mid":"Levels 3-5 even out as his resets and attack speed ramp while your sustain absorbs his poke-backs - neither side has a clean kill, so bank blobs and track junglers. Your free win is Meditate: it is a channel on a flat 10s, so any knockup ends it and he eats the whole cooldown having healed nothing.","late":"His first item is the turn: Wuju true damage burns blob sustain faster than you regenerate and the duel is his from here to the end - by two items his shred melts even your giant HP pool. Stop 1v1ing entirely; your job is the E-R engage that knocks his team airborne. Highlander is a flat 85s and kills cut it further.","whys":["Q poke and blob sustain out-trade his bare level-1 kit.","At 2 your lash-poke and healing beat his single Alpha Strike.","Level 3 evens; his autos keep cutting Alpha Strike's cooldown.","Levels 4-5 stay even — break his 10s Meditate with any knockup.","At 6 Highlander ignores your slows — only knockups bite.","First item his DPS burns through your blob sustain and he out-duels you.","Late, his sustained DPS shreds a tanky but non-duelist Zac."]});
